(e) Prepare and improvise teaching and learning resources;
(f) Conduct formative assessment regularly by using tools that assess theory and practice including brainstorming, 
checklist, experiments, questionnaires, face to face questions, classroom exercises, individual and group 
practicals, projects and portifolios. Other tools include tests, classroom presentations, mid-term, term and annual 
